  "description": "Successor to rule-artifact.v12 (ADR 0077). Adds the shared_key_count expression (Part 1), an optional four-group basis declaration (Part 2), and an exclusive-presence selection as an alternative to value (Part 4), whose paths and default each carry a reads_subject_results list (Part 3) and whose source_nonempty activity may name member_fact_types. subject is optional so a return-level selection rule can be declared; joined still requires subject. No aggregation. Declared pin origins are unchanged from v12. v1-v12 remain immutable history."
}
